  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside the Door of Life and Death, Immortal Zombie Giant Sun activates the immortal killer move against dozens of Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s giant arms. A drizzle of dazzling golden light spreads and weaves into an exquisite golden web; past halfway coverage the arms shake fiercely and Fang Yuan’s pressure drops sharply. At full coverage the arms turn upward to strike Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s main body; Spectral Soul destroys those traitorous arms, and the golden web loses its targets and returns to a golden light drizzle.",
